ds/origins/40cb012b-f76a-4d64-a4e5-9bbfad9253e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fb1003a85052419649d734450efff581 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I would like to request a full-body portrait of the character \u9b3c\u4eba\u6b63\u90aa. This is meant to be a Touhou-NASCAR crossover, so there are some requirements.\nRegarding the costume:\nPlease refer to the picture in the reference link. Please draw the same as shown in the picture, including every logo on the suit. However, please remove the 'CBell' Logo on the waist part(That's the driver's name) and replace it with something related to the character. If you need more details please search for \"Christopher Bell\" and \"Rheem racing\". \nRegarding the Posture:\nNo exact posture requirements but the posture should make the character look like a NASCAR driver.\nRegarding the background:\nPlease search for \"NASCAR On FOX 2022 Graphics\" on YouTube and refer to the background art style of the driver graphics (for example 0:35). For this request, it doesn't have to be that complicated but should at least look similar to the references. Colors appearing in the background should match the character.\n\nhttps://www.sportskeeda.com/nascar/news-christopher-bell-says-very-tough-weekend-despite-p2-finish-nascar-richmond-race", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Gomashiopappa_K/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3069191, "client_id": 41262, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f4f3c003/uploads/origins/04176916-31cc-4833-847d-549e80b2de57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a45b5e76524f7f40d5c28f5d123df27", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f4f3c003/uploads/origins/04176916-31cc-4833-847d-549e80b2de57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=